{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731160/extras/d63427def672e0c0aca51cf56ad7edfc.avif?t=1767727082\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In a real-time flying Race</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You fly through the checkpoints as fast as you can. Use full-use of your flight controls in 3D-Space to build a track through all the checkpoints as fast as possible. But be careful, crashes will slow you down and if you hit your own track \u2192 it's game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731160/extras/8f3ba39f877c24be1e7c2b48084abbe0.poster.avif?t=1767727082\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731160/extras/8f3ba39f877c24be1e7c2b48084abbe0.webm?t=1767727082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731160/extras/8f3ba39f877c24be1e7c2b48084abbe0.mp4?t=1767727082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731160/extras/556c2b1b7d3f995431c04b98bb1545f0.avif?t=1767727082\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the track you built yourself. For the race on track you can make use of your already existing driving skills as you will need to drive perfect turns to get the highest score possible. Your build and race time together will determine your score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat your own ghost and get faster and faster. Compare yourself with your friends on a global leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731160/extras/954377800eac867c47f9570a5d56a725.poster.avif?t=1767727082\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731160/extras/954377800eac867c47f9570a5d56a725.webm?t=1767727082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731160/extras/954377800eac867c47f9570a5d56a725.mp4?t=1767727082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731160/extras/ecb2ace9cb4d0c0433c6d21e8d219bbc.avif?t=1767727082\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with up to 4 Player in exciting short rounds in the local multiplayer. First all players build a track at the same time. If you hit a track of someone else or your own, you will have to restart. Whoever gets to the finish first will gain the most points. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731160/extras/e421ffa40b65addfa439e6b9c49cad7a.poster.avif?t=1767727082\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731160/extras/e421ffa40b65addfa439e6b9c49cad7a.webm?t=1767727082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731160/extras/e421ffa40b65addfa439e6b9c49cad7a.mp4?t=1767727082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the building is complete, all players will race the tracks of each other. First to finish gets the most points. Will you come out on top?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731160/extras/d85416ed3d7f145ed1684321ffdc6d83.poster.avif?t=1767727082\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731160/extras/d85416ed3d7f145ed1684321ffdc6d83.webm?t=1767727082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731160/extras/d85416ed3d7f145ed1684321ffdc6d83.mp4?t=1767727082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*To play the Local-Multiplayer you will need to have a controller connected for each player.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2731160?t=1767727082","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731160/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767727082","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731160/cb97cce3b3fcd7c848eef49aec8ec22543f6a158/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767727082","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731160/cb97cce3b3fcd7c848eef49aec8ec22543f6a158/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767727082","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Remote Play on TV","id":43},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Playtest</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731160/extras/ae9aa70594c9ec68465d606760df9939.avif?t=1767727082\" width=616 height=155 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get Access to the Playtest version for free today! Sign up on supersonicbridgeracing.ch to exclusively test the game.</p></p><br><h1>Join the community</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731160/extras/6042a8a67937ae4c02d1908b4250dc00.avif?t=1767727082\" width=616 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wanna show off your blazing fast race times, help squish some bugs, and share your awesome ideas? Join the Supersonic Bridge Racing community on Discord &lt;3</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731160/extras/d63427def672e0c0aca51cf56ad7edfc.avif?t=1767727082\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In a real-time flying Race</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You fly through the checkpoints as fast as you can. Use full-use of your flight controls in 3D-Space to build a track through all the checkpoints as fast as possible. But be careful, crashes will slow you down and if you hit your own track \u2192 it's game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731160/extras/8f3ba39f877c24be1e7c2b48084abbe0.poster.avif?t=1767727082\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731160/extras/8f3ba39f877c24be1e7c2b48084abbe0.webm?t=1767727082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731160/extras/8f3ba39f877c24be1e7c2b48084abbe0.mp4?t=1767727082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731160/extras/556c2b1b7d3f995431c04b98bb1545f0.avif?t=1767727082\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the track you built yourself. For the race on track you can make use of your already existing driving skills as you will need to drive perfect turns to get the highest score possible. Your build and race time together will determine your score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat your own ghost and get faster and faster. Compare yourself with your friends on a global leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731160/extras/954377800eac867c47f9570a5d56a725.poster.avif?t=1767727082\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731160/extras/954377800eac867c47f9570a5d56a725.webm?t=1767727082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731160/extras/954377800eac867c47f9570a5d56a725.mp4?t=1767727082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731160/extras/ecb2ace9cb4d0c0433c6d21e8d219bbc.avif?t=1767727082\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with up to 4 Player in exciting short rounds in the local multiplayer. First all players build a track at the same time. If you hit a track of someone else or your own, you will have to restart. Whoever gets to the finish first will gain the most points. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731160/extras/e421ffa40b65addfa439e6b9c49cad7a.poster.avif?t=1767727082\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731160/extras/e421ffa40b65addfa439e6b9c49cad7a.webm?t=1767727082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731160/extras/e421ffa40b65addfa439e6b9c49cad7a.mp4?t=1767727082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the building is complete, all players will race the tracks of each other. First to finish gets the most points. Will you come out on top?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731160/extras/d85416ed3d7f145ed1684321ffdc6d83.poster.avif?t=1767727082\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731160/extras/d85416ed3d7f145ed1684321ffdc6d83.webm?t=1767727082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731160/extras/d85416ed3d7f145ed1684321ffdc6d83.mp4?t=1767727082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*To play the Local-Multiplayer you will need to have a controller connected for each player.</p>","developers":["Stumi Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},